      "description": "UHD Postings UHS Home Job Search My Profile Kiosk mode Opportunities at UH Downtown Campus Skip to jobs search results Category Search categories 4 filter options found Category Adjunct (0 items) 0 Faculty (0 items) 0 Staff (0 items) 0 Student & temporary (41 items) 41 Employment Type Search employment types 2 filter options found Employment Type Full-Time (0 items) 0 Part-Time (41 items) 41 Department Search 48 filter options found Department Academic Advising (2 items) 2 Academic Affairs (0 items) 0 Academic Support Center (1 items) 1 Accessible Education Center (1 items) 1 Accounting & Int'l Business (0 items) 0 Administration & Finance (2 items) 2 Arts & Communication (2 items) 2 Auxiliary Services (1 items) 1 Budget Office (0 items) 0 Business Affairs (1 items) 1 Campus Solutions Services (0 items) 0 Center for Career & Profession (1 items) 1 Community Engagement (3 items) 3 Computer Sci & Engr Technology (1 items) 1 Conference & Event Services (1 items) 1 Continuing Education (1 items) 1 Criminal Justice (0 items) 0 Ctr fr Stud Leadship & Involnt (2 items) 2 Distance Education (1 items) 1 English (0 items) 0 Enterprise Systems (0 items) 0 Fin, Inf Sys, Econ & Risk Mgmt (1 items) 1 Financial Aid (1 items) 1 Gator Success Institute (2 items) 2 Gen Bus, Market & Supp Chain (0 items) 0 History,Humanities & Languages (1 items) 1 Honors Programs (1 items) 1 Human Resources (1 items) 1 Humanities & Social Sciences (1 items) 1 Information Technology (1 items) 1 Institutional Effectiveness (1 items) 1 Library (2 items) 2 M Davies College of Business (1 items) 1 Management (0 items) 0 Mathematics and Statistics (0 items) 0 Natural Sciences (0 items) 0 Office of the President (0 items) 0 Police (0 items) 0 Psychology (1 items) 1 Sciences & Technology (1 items) 1 Social Sciences (0 items) 0 Social Work (0 items) 0 Sports and Fitness (4 items) 4 UHD Law Enforcement Academy (0 items) 0 Undergraduate Admissions (0 items) 0 University Relations (1 items) 1 Urban Education (0 items) 0 Veterans Services (1 items) 1 Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Jobs near me Student & temporary Sort by: Last Updated Last Updated: Newest to Oldest Last Updated: Oldest to Newest Title: A-Z Title: Z-A Federal Work-Study|  LEGACI Program Assistant Student & temporary Part-Time Gator Success Institute The Program Assistant supports the administrative and logistical functions of the L.E.G.A.C.I. Student Success Program, ensuring the smooth operation of success workshops, events, and daily office tasks. This role involves filing, data entry, answering phone calls, and preparing rooms for events, making it integral to the efficient functioning of the program. Read more Federal Work-Study| LEGACI Peer Mentors Student & temporary Part-Time Gator Success Institute The Peer Mentor will serve as a supportive guide, role model, and resource for students participating in the L.E.G.A.C.I. Student Success Program at the University of Houston-Downtown. By building meaningful connections and providing assistance, the Peer Mentor plays a crucial role in fostering academic success, personal growth, and engagement within the campus community. Read more Federal Work-Study| Advising Center CHSS Student & temporary Part-Time Academic Advising Federal Work-Study - Advising Center, CHSS Read more Non-College Work-Study| Student Administrative Assistant, Continuing Education Student & temporary Part-Time Continuing Education Located at the UHD @1801 Location. We are seeking a reliable, detail-oriented, and proactive student assistant to join our administrative team. This position provides critical day-to-day office support in a fast-paced environment. The ideal candidate possesses exceptional customer service skills, thrives while multitasking, and excels at handling high-volume communication across multiple platforms. Read more Federal Work-Study| Social Media Specialist Student & temporary Part-Time University Relations This position is responsible for creating student-centered content for UHD's social media channels, with an emphasis on video production, as well as posting event listings to media websites. Read more Federal Work-Study| Accessible Education Center Student & temporary Part-Time Accessible Education Center Student workers provide administrative and customer service support to the Accessible Education Center (AEC). Read more Federal Work-Study| Student Assistant, Academic Support Center Student & temporary Part-Time Academic Support Center The Academic Support Center Student Assistant is responsible for supporting ASC student services and programs. Student Assistants monitor access to the ASC, greet visitors, schedule appointments, answer phone calls, check out materials, and support student promotional events. Read more Texas Work-Study|  Community Engagement and Service Learning Student & temporary Part-Time Community Engagement The Center for Community Engagement and Service Learning vision is to build bridges to the community to create a more engaged campus, cultivate social responsibility, and develop a vibrant learning environment for UHD students.  Our department is seeking a student worker for our office, as well as student workers to place at off-campus nonprofit or government organizations for fall/spring semesters. Read more Federal Work-Study| Community Engagement Student & temporary Part-Time Community Engagement The Center for Community Engagement and Service Learning vision is to build bridges to the community to create a more engaged campus, cultivate social responsibility, and develop a vibrant learning environment for UHD students. Our department is seeking a student worker for our office. Read more Non-College Work-Study| The FISER Department Student & temporary Part-Time Fin, Inf Sys, Econ & Risk Mgmt The FISER Department is seeking Student Research Assistants to support the development and pilot testing of Smart Pathways—an AI-driven mobile application funded by the Powell Foundation that utilizes natural language processing (NLP) and machine learning (ML) to assist underserved Houston students in navigating the college application process. Read more Non-College Work-Study| Digital Communications Student Worker Student & temporary Part-Time M Davies College of Business The Marilyn Davies College of Business seeks reliable students to assist with maintaining active social media channels for positively promoting the College. While messaging on social media can be conducted from any location with internet access, engaging with the individuals necessary to build content occurs within the college. Therefore, this position will require time spent physically in the college. Read more Texas Work-Study | Financial Aid Student & temporary Part-Time Financial Aid The Office of Financial Aid is seeking enthusiastic, dependable, and customer-focused student employees to support daily office operations and enrollment initiatives. Read more Federal Work-Study| Business Affairs Student & temporary Part-Time Business Affairs Business Affairs is seeking a motivated and reliable student assistant for the Fall/Spring 2026-2027 semesters. Read more Non-College Work-Study| Student Assistant, Student Leadership and Involvement Student & temporary Part-Time Ctr fr Stud Leadship & Involnt Student Leadership and Involvement (SLI) is seeking a dependable, engaged student to support daily operations in the Student Lounge and throughout the department. This role provides a unique opportunity to develop leadership, communication, and administrative skills in a dynamic, student-centered environment. Read more Texas Work-Study| Wellness & Success Center, Student Assistant (part-time) Student & temporary Part-Time Sports and Fitness Texas Work-Study| Wellness & Success Center, Student Assistant (part-time) Read more Federal Work-Study| Student Assistant, Student Leadership and Involvement Student & temporary Part-Time Ctr fr Stud Leadship & Involnt Student Leadership and Involvement (SLI) is seeking a dependable, engaged student to support daily operations in the Student Lounge and throughout the department. This role provides a unique opportunity to develop leadership, communication, and administrative skills in a dynamic, student-centered environment. Read more Federal Work-study | Center for Social Inquiry and Transformation Student & temporary Part-Time Humanities & Social Sciences Federal Workstudy Read more Federal Work-Study|Arts & Communication Student & temporary Part-Time Arts & Communication Federal Workstudy Read more Texas Work-Study| Interlibrary Loan Student Worker Student & temporary Part-Time Library The Interlibrary Loan (ILL) Student Worker performs daily tasks throughout the ILL department, processes Interlibrary Loan requests using the Tipasa software system, and tracks unclaimed loans and shipped items Read more Federal Work-Study| Wellness Center Attendant Student & temporary Part-Time Sports and Fitness The Sports & Fitness, Wellness Center Attendant is responsible for supporting the structure, direction, services, and programs of the Wellness & Success Center. Specifically, this includes monitoring access to the building, answering phone and university ID requests, checking out equipment, and providing facility information to members. Monitoring the activities on the 1st, 2nd, and 3rd floor Fitness Center areas, as well as overlooking the activities in the gymnasium, bouldering wall, fitness studios, and running track. Read more Federal Work-Study| Computer Science & Engineering Technology Student & temporary Part-Time Computer Sci & Engr Technology The Computer Science & Engineering Technology Department is currently seeking applicants to fill college work-study positions. Read more Project Management Office Assistant Student & temporary Part-Time Information Technology Student Work-Study |Project Management Office Assistant Read more Temporary Non-Exempt, Figure Model Student & temporary Part-Time Arts & Communication The Arts & Communication Department is seeking figure models to support studio art courses. Models will be required to pose for the full duration of scheduled three-hour figure drawing classes. These positions are temporary, hourly, non-benefits eligible roles, hired on an as-needed basis to meet course requirements. Read more Texas Workstudy | Library Public Service Student Worker Student & temporary Part-Time Library Texas Work-Study position assisting library staff with daily tasks. Read more Federal Work-Study | Web Tech Assistant Student & temporary Part-Time Sciences & Technology The College of Sciences and Technology invites eligible Federal Work-Study students to apply for the Web Technology Assistant position. Read more Non-College Work-Study| Academic Advising Center - AVP Student & temporary Part-Time Academic Advising The Student Worker for Academic Advising Center - AVP provides administrative, outreach, and operational support to the Assistant Vice President for Advising and Student Progression and the Director of Academic Planning and Experience. Read more Federal Work-Study| History, Humanities & Languages CHSS Student & temporary Part-Time History,Humanities & Languages The Department of History, Humanities, and Languages is hiring a student assistant to support daily office operations. Key duties include administrative support, front desk service, document management, event coordination, and data entry. Candidates should be organized, professional, and skilled in communication and Microsoft Office (especially Excel). Applicants must be currently enrolled UHD students with at least a 2.0 GPA and availability to work 15–20 hours per week. The role offers practical administrative experience in an academic setting. Read more Non College Work-Study | Comp/Tele & Video Net Student & temporary Part-Time Administration & Finance Position Summary\nThe Student Comp/Opts Work-Study provides technical support to the University of Houston-Downtown (UHD) faculty and Staff by assisting with the installation, maintenance, troubleshooting, and relocation of computer hardware and peripheral equipment. This position delivers excellent customer service while supporting daily IT operations, technology deployments, and campus events.\n\nDuties\n• Responds to emails and tickets regarding technical equipment problems.\n• Troubleshoots and repairs computers, printers, and peripheral equipment.\n• Moves and relocates computer equipment throughout the university.\n• Completes all paperwork necessary for equipment moves, inventory updates, and department invoices.\n• Provides onsite support and IT equipment setups for other departments' events and for outside vendors when requested.\n• Performs other duties as assigned.\n\nQualifications\n• Must be a current student at UHD.\n• Must be able to work a flexible working schedule, including weekends.\n• Prefer prior customer service-related experience.\n* Preference will be given to students who are eligible for and participating in the Federal Work-Study (FWS) at UHD\n*All currently enrolled UHD students who meet the minimum qualifications are encouraged to apply.\n\nKnowledge, Skills, and Abilities\n• Have basic computer hardware troubleshooting knowledge.\n• Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.\n• Strong written and oral communication skills.\n• Ability to operate tools and peripheral equipment.\n• Ability to effectively prioritize and execute tasks.\n• Ability to move items up to 50 lbs. Read more Federal Work-Study| Center for Career & Professional Development Student & temporary Part-Time Center for Career & Profession The Center for Career and Professional Development is seeking hard-working, dynamic students to join our team! In addition to making a difference in the lives of your fellow students, you will develop skills employers seek, including written and verbal communication skills, the ability to work as a member of a team, professionalism, and the confidence to take the initiative on the job. When you work at the CCPD, you are preparing yourself for future professional success! Read more Federal Work-Study| Veterans Services Student & temporary Part-Time Veterans Services The Department of Veteran Services is looking for a Federal Work-Study Student to assist with managing the front desk and with various other clerical duties. Read more Displaying 1 - 30 of 41 in total ‹ 1 2 › Academic Affairs Administration Bookstore Online Campus Carry Policy Community Engagement Compact with Texans Disability Services Fraud & Non-Compliance Hotline Fraud Reporting (State of Texas) Human Resources Library Linking Notice Mental Health Resources Open Records Parking & Transportation Services UHD Police Department Privacy Notice Quality Enhancement Plan SACSCOC Sexual Misconduct & Discrimination Reporting Site Policies State of Texas State Required Reports Student Achievement Student Conduct Incident Report Texas Homeland Security Texas Public Information Act (TPIA) Texas Veterans Portal TRAIL (Statewide Search) University of Houston System University of Houston-Downtown One Main Street Houston, TX 77002 713-221-8000 Visitor Parking and Uber/Lyft Stop 201 Girard Street Houston, TX 77002 Mission and Vision Contact Information A–Z Index Institutional Resume UHD Directory Copyright © 2026 Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalise content such as job recommendations, and to analyse our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Profile link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
