rar Student Counseling Services Student Government Association Student Handbook Student Health Services Student Success and Student Life Testing Services The Writing and Reading Center Tutoring Resources Veteran Services Student Life Student Life Bookstore Catalog Dateline Downtown Dean of Students Events Calendar eSports Gator Resource Center iRadio Sports & Fitness Student Leadership & Involvement Student Organizations Student Success and Student Life UHD / Human Resources / Careers at UHD / Student Employment Student Employment Navigate This Section HR Home Careers at UHD Student Employment Temporary Employment Veteran's Preference Former Foster Preference Benefits Student employment is a great way to build transferable skills and stay connected\n                           to campus while you’re pursuing your degree. The University of Houston-Downtown offers\n                           a wide range of on-campus job opportunities designed specifically for students, with\n                           flexible schedules that work around your classes and academic commitments. Whether you’re looking to gain experience related to your major, explore a new career\n                           path, or simply earn extra income, working on campus helps you grow professionally\n                           while being part of the UHD community. Student jobs are more than just work—they’re\n                           opportunities to develop skills, make connections, and prepare for life after graduation. To view current opportunities on campus, check out our Student Job Board . See room for improvement? Fill out this HR Website Feedback Form to provide input. One Main Street Houston, TX 77002 713-221-8000 Visitor Parking & Ride Share 201 Girard Street Houston, TX 77002 A–Z Index Academic Affairs Accessible Education Center Accreditation Campus Carry Policy Canvas Compact with Texans Directory Human Resources Information Technology Library Mental Health Resources Parking & Transp